      "value": "@{5acad9ecc9dba010c9c3ec68|full_name}: Still the same. Without VRC+ you can enter the gallery and go into the Take New Photo option for both My User Icons and My Images.\nYou can take a photo and when you go to Save & Apply it says Uploading Image/Saving Image for a moment depending on which photo you are on and then just shows Save & Apply again with no error message and nothing is added to the gallery tab.\nError log for My User Icons take new photo:\n2021.05.30 04:04:52 Log        -  Took screenshot to: \n2021.05.30 04:04:54 Log        -  Attempting to upload user icon.\n2021.05.30 04:04:55 Error      -  [API] [102, 400, Post, 2] Request Finished with Error!\nhttps://api.vrchat.cloud/api/1/icon?apiKey=*******&organization=vrchat\nNo Exception\n{{\"error\":{{\"message\":\"You do not have permission to perform this action․\",\"status_code\":400}}}}\n2021.05.30 04:04:55 Error      -  Error uploading user icon: You do not have permission to perform this action․\nError log for My Images take new photo: \n2021.05.30 04:05:04 Log        -  Took screenshot to: \n2021.05.30 04:05:06 Error      -  [API] [109, 401, Post, 2] Request Finished with Error!\nhttps://api.vrchat.cloud/api/1/gallery?apiKey=*******&organization=vrchat\nNo Exception\n{{\"error\":{{\"message\":\"\\\"You don't have permission to perform this action.\\\"\",\"status_code\":401}}}}\n2021.05.30 04:05:06 Log        -  Error uploading image: \"You don't have permission to perform this action.\"\nObscured API key in both to be safe",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
